By <balanced factorial orthogonality>, omitting B adds $SS_B$ to the full additive residual: **$\operatorname{RSS}_{A\text{-only}}=2.6867+0.4033=3.0900$**. This model has $3$ parameters and $9$ residual <degrees of freedom>.

= iv
